        <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,38px);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:16px">Is window tint legal in Florida?</h2>
        <p style="color:#A8A5AC;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:26px">Front side windows must stay at 28% VLT or lighter; sedan rears at 15%. We install to spec so you stay legal — here's the full breakdown for 2026.</p>
        <a href={routes.floridaLaws} class="bc-cta-btn" style="background:#C81878;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px">Read Florida tint laws <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></a>
      </div>
